-- Place constants for reference:
-- client_closed: Client in CLOSED state
-- client_syn_sent: Client sent SYN, waiting for SYN-ACK
-- client_established: Client connection established
-- client_fin_wait: Client sent FIN, waiting to close
-- server_listen: Server listening for connections
-- server_syn_received: Server received SYN, sent SYN-ACK
