-- Transition constants for reference:
-- send_syn: Client sends SYN to server
-- send_syn_ack: Server receives SYN, sends SYN-ACK
-- send_ack: Client receives SYN-ACK, sends ACK - connection established
-- send_fin: Client initiates connection teardown with FIN
-- send_fin_ack: Server acknowledges FIN
-- close: Both sides close the connection
